          {
            "context": "This verse directly parallels the hadith’s first beatitude. In Quran 14:28, God condemns ‘those who exchanged the favour of God for ingratitude’ (alladhina baddaluu ni’mata Allahi kufran), using nearly identical wording to the Imam’s statement. The Imam’s teaching inverts the Quranic condemnation into a positive beatitude.",
